{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 9,
    "江雪": 9,
    "言笑": 28
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2200301",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑交谈",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030101": {
            "id": "220030101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "哼，也亏得他能腆着个脸，蹭吃蹭喝这么久…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030102"
            ]
          },
          "220030102": {
            "id": "220030102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你在做什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030103"
            ]
          },
          "220030103": {
            "id": "220030103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "我？我正在给某个吃白食的家伙做饭。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030104"
            ]
          },
          "220030104": {
            "id": "220030104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "成天一副游手好闲的样子，来客栈帮个工都不肯。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030105"
            ]
          },
          "220030105": {
            "id": "220030105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "天天钓鱼，也没见着钓出个多大的鱼来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030106"
            ]
          },
          "220030106": {
            "id": "220030106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "要是没我，早晚得饿死在客栈旁边！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030107"
            ]
          },
          "220030107": {
            "id": "220030107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "算了，不说了，反正说了他也听不到，听到了也装作听不到。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030108"
            ]
          },
          "220030108": {
            "id": "220030108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你有空的话，去帮我找点菜来吧，我这的菜有点不够用了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030109"
            ]
          },
          "220030109": {
            "id": "220030109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "也不用多，就找一个<color=#00E1FFFF>绝云椒椒</color>，和一个<color=#00E1FFFF>莲蓬</color>来就行了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030111",
              "220030113"
            ]
          },
          "220030111": {
            "id": "220030111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "行，你找了就回来，我赶紧把菜给做了。"
          },
          "220030113": {
            "id": "220030113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "那是老板花的钱，他个吃白食的给钱了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030114"
            ]
          },
          "220030114": {
            "id": "220030114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "这些菜都是我自己出的钱…哼，我真是欠了他的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030115"
            ]
          },
          "220030115": {
            "id": "220030115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "行了，你快去快回吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200302",
      "subQuestName": "帮言笑找到绝云椒椒和莲蓬",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030201": {
            "id": "220030201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你找好菜了没有？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030204"
            ]
          },
          "220030204": {
            "id": "220030204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你…你尽量快点，不然那个吃白食又得饿出个好歹来了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200303",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030301": {
            "id": "220030301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你在这等等，我把菜做好你顺便送过去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030302"
            ]
          },
          "220030302": {
            "id": "220030302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你这是什么表情，我不会让你白打工，该给多少我就给你多少。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030303"
            ]
          },
          "220030303": {
            "id": "220030303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "行了，你把饭给那个吃白食的送过去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030304"
            ]
          },
          "220030304": {
            "id": "220030304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "那家伙叫<color=#00E1FFFF>江雪</color>，一直在水边钓鱼，一眼就能看见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200304",
      "subQuestName": "把言笑做好的菜送给江雪",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030501": {
            "id": "220030501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "咦？你来找我有事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030502"
            ]
          },
          "220030502": {
            "id": "220030502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这是言笑给你的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030503"
            ]
          },
          "220030503": {
            "id": "220030503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "我说这股香味是从哪来，这厨子的手艺果然不错。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030504"
            ]
          },
          "220030504": {
            "id": "220030504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "谢谢你，回去的时候，也记得帮我谢谢他。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200305",
      "subQuestName": "回去找言笑回报",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030601": {
            "id": "220030601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "饭送到了没有？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030602"
            ]
          },
          "220030602": {
            "id": "220030602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "送到了，他说…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030603"
            ]
          },
          "220030603": {
            "id": "220030603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "哼，你别说了，那个吃白食的肯定又要说谢谢之类的穷酸话。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030604"
            ]
          },
          "220030604": {
            "id": "220030604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "这些年听着我耳朵都起了茧了，谢什么谢，有什么好谢的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030605"
            ]
          },
          "220030605": {
            "id": "220030605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "有空说谢谢，有空去钓鱼，不如来客栈打工赚钱！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030606"
            ]
          },
          "220030606": {
            "id": "220030606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "啧，我和你说这个做什么，这是给你的报酬，拿好了，忙你的去吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200304",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030401": {
            "id": "220030401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "快点去吧，免得那个吃白食的饿出个好歹来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030402"
            ]
          },
          "220030402": {
            "id": "220030402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你为什么要送饭给他？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030403"
            ]
          },
          "220030403": {
            "id": "220030403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "问这个做什么，他个孤家寡人，整个璃月港只认识我一个人，也只敢到我这来蹭吃蹭喝。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030404"
            ]
          },
          "220030404": {
            "id": "220030404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "原因？你还要什么原因，我乐意管他饭，行了吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030405"
            ]
          },
          "220030405": {
            "id": "220030405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "再说，要是我不管他的饭，他再去荻花洲发一次疯怎么办…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030406"
            ]
          },
          "220030406": {
            "id": "220030406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你怎么还在这！快去快去！磨蹭什么呢？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2200307",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220030701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220030701": {
            "id": "220030701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "唔？快些回去吧，那厨子等急了，说不定又要发飙了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030702"
            ]
          },
          "220030702": {
            "id": "220030702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "他为什么要送饭给你？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030703"
            ]
          },
          "220030703": {
            "id": "220030703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "我们是…认识了很久的朋友。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030704"
            ]
          },
          "220030704": {
            "id": "220030704",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "嗯…我之前去了荻花洲一趟，做了件我必须做的错事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030705"
            ]
          },
          "220030705": {
            "id": "220030705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "整座璃月港，只有这家客栈让我住，那个厨子管我的饭。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030706"
            ]
          },
          "220030706": {
            "id": "220030706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "再往下讲就没完了，而且你也没那么多时间听我讲故事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220030707"
            ]
          },
          "220030707": {
            "id": "220030707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "江雪",
            "text": "好了，快回去吧，那厨子一向是没什么耐心的。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}